---
import PrivacyLayout from "@/layouts/PrivacyLayout.astro";

/*
  MyPlanorra data/apps.ts içinde kayıtlı değil: uygulama henüz yayımlanmadı ve
  o dosya ana sayfayı, /apps listesini ve sitemap'i besliyor. Oraya eklemek
  uygulamayı vaktinden önce siteye çıkarır, üstelik sitemap'e henüz var olmayan
  bir /apps/myplanorra/ adresi yazardı. Bu yüzden sayfa yalnızca ihtiyaç duyduğu
  iki alanı kendisi veriyor.

  Metin de yer tutucu değil: MyPlanorra hiçbir veri toplamıyor, hiçbir ağ isteği
  yapmıyor ve üçüncü taraf servis kullanmıyor. Ortak yer tutucu metin bunun
  tersini söylediği için mağaza incelemesinde uyuşmazlık sebebi olurdu.
*/
const app = { slug: "myplanorra", name: "MyPlanorra" };
---

<PrivacyLayout app={app} updated="August 7, 2026" backHref="/" backLabel="Back to AkuAPPs">
  <p>
    MyPlanorra collects no data. There is no account, no sign-in, and no network connection: the app
    never sends anything anywhere, because it makes no network requests at all. Everything you enter
    stays in a database file on your own device.
  </p>

  <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
  <p>
    None. MyPlanorra contains no analytics, no crash reporting, no advertising, and no tracking of any
    kind. We never see your tasks, payments, balances, savings, debts, medication records, or photos,
    and they are never transmitted to us or to anyone else.
  </p>

  <h2>Where Your Data Is Stored</h2>
  <p>
    Everything you enter is saved locally on your device. The app never connects to a bank or any other
    service, and it never asks for card numbers, banking passwords, or one-time codes. On Android,
    automatic system backup is switched off, so your database is not copied to your Google account.
  </p>

  <h2>Permissions</h2>
  <p>
    <strong>Notifications</strong> are used only for local reminders you create yourself. There are no
    push notifications and no remote server involved.
  </p>
  <p>
    <strong>Camera and photo library</strong> access is used only when you attach a photo to an item in
    the Trading section. The photo is copied into the app's own folder and never leaves your device.
    Location and camera metadata (EXIF) are not copied. Each permission is requested the first time you
    use the feature, never at launch.
  </p>

  <h2>Backups and Exports</h2>
  <p>
    You can export a backup as a JSON file and a month-end report as an Excel file. You create these
    files yourself, and they are handed to your device's share sheet. Once you save or send such a file
    it is outside the app and under your control; if you place it in a cloud drive or send it to
    someone, that service's rules apply rather than ours.
  </p>

  <h2>Third Party Services</h2>
  <p>
    There are none. The app contains no third party analytics, advertising, or tracking libraries, and
    shares no data with anyone. Brand icons shown next to some entries come from the open source
    simple-icons set and are drawn from data inside the app; displaying one does not contact the brand
    and does not imply any affiliation.
  </p>

  <h2>Children's Privacy</h2>
  <p>
    The app is suitable for all ages and collects no personal information from anyone, including
    children.
  </p>

  <h2>Losing Your Data</h2>
  <p>
    Because your data exists in exactly one place, your device, deleting the app or losing the device
    deletes it too. We cannot recover it, since we never had a copy. Please take backups regularly.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes To This Policy</h2>
  <p>
    If this policy changes, the date at the top of this page changes with it. Material changes are also
    noted in the app's release notes.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact Us</h2>
  <p>
    For privacy questions about MyPlanorra, contact AkuAPPs at
    <a href="mailto:hello@akuapps.com"> hello@akuapps.com</a>.
  </p>
</PrivacyLayout>
